# The same Tunnel with a second Wall in play: only Wall of Shadows refuses
# (SourceCanOnlyTarget$ is a property of the target's static, not of the
# spell), so Wall of Wood is a legal target and is destroyed while Wall of
# Shadows stays.
startturn ai
advance 3
tapformana ai 2 R
queue targets 4
queue action ai cast 3
passpriority
